.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-inline-detach 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-inline\-detach \- Splits Signatures from an Inline\-Signed Message
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop inline\-detach\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] <\fB\-\-signatures\-out\fR> [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Splits Signatures from an Inline\-Signed Message
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor the signatures
.TP
\fB\-\-signatures\-out\fR \fI<SIGNATURES_OUT>\fR
Write Signatures here
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
